{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmailTags:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tags","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEmail:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to associate with the email."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Supported value types: NSString, NSNumber, NSArray, NSNull (to delete).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"tags"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The email address to associate tags with. Must be a valid email format.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"email"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates tags with an email address independently of the current device."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is used for email-specific segmentation in Pushwoosh Email campaigns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Email tags are separate from device tags:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Device tags: Associated with push token, used for push segmentation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Email tags: Associated with email address, used for email segmentation"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this for email-specific attributes like email preferences, engagement metrics,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or email-only campaign targeting."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update email campaign preferences:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class EmailPreferencesManager {","","    func updateEmailPreferences(for email: String, preferences: EmailPreferences) {","        let tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"email_frequency\": preferences.frequency.rawValue,","            \"email_categories\": preferences.subscribedCategories.map { $0.rawValue },","            \"email_format\": preferences.preferHTML ? \"html\" : \"plain\",","            \"unsubscribed_categories\": preferences.unsubscribedCategories.map { $0.rawValue },","            \"last_preference_update\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date())","        ]","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmailTags(tags, forEmail: email)","    }","","    func trackEmailEngagement(email: String, campaignId: String, action: EmailAction) {","        let engagementTags: [String: Any] = [","            \"last_email_open\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","            \"email_engagement_score\": calculateEngagementScore(for: email),","            \"last_clicked_campaign\": action == .clicked ? campaignId : NSNull()","        ]","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmailTags(engagementTags, forEmail: email)","    }","}"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemailtags:foremail:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets tags for a specific email address in email campaigns.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ",